  "title": "Kopin to Participate in Canaccord Genuity’s 46th Annual Growth Conference",
  "summary": "WESTBOROUGH, Mass. – Kopin Corporation (NASDAQ: KOPN), a leading provider of application-specific optical systems and high-performance microdisplays for defense, training, enterprise, industrial, consumer and medical products, today announced that management will attend Canaccord Genuity’s 46th Annual Growth Conference taking place August 11-13, 2026 in Boston, Massachusetts. Kopin’s Chief Executive Officer Michael Murray is scheduled to […]",
